Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.40,0:00:07.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,0)}The radiance of the night shines through my window
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.17,0:00:11.12,Opening,,0,0,0,,but the path to immortality is long.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.60,0:00:15.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.85,0:00:21.01,Opening,,0,0,0,,Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.28,0:00:25.00,Opening,,0,0,0,,Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.40,0:00:28.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.25,0:00:33.52,Opening,,0,0,0,,The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.72,0:00:37.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.84,0:00:40.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,as the storm rages just below.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.88,0:00:44.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.85,0:00:47.84,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:50.69,Opening,,0,0,0,,why the world is a-changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.71,0:00:54.04,Opening,,0,0,0,,Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.28,0:00:57.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.21,0:01:00.29,Opening,,0,0,0,,experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.45,0:01:03.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will defy the light in the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.17,0:01:06.61,Opening,,0,0,0,,to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.69,0:01:19.05,Opening,,0,0,0,,Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.21,0:01:22.13,Opening,,0,0,0,,Transform your insignificant body into light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.29,0:01:25.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,The hardships of the journey
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.37,0:01:28.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,will temper this young man's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.21,0:01:32.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.60,0:01:43.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,690)\fad(1000,1000)}Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.84,0:01:58.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Greetings, Immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.24,0:02:01.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,In which direction is the country of Zhao ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.20,0:02:04.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Lord Immortal,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.12,0:02:05.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Zhao is in this direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.84,0:02:08.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,But there is a dangerous place on the way
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.12,0:02:09.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,called the Black Swamp.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.48,0:02:10.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,That place is cursed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.72,0:02:13.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Neither Immortals nor mortals can go through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.44,0:02:15.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,I suggest you avoi...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.52,0:02:16.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.04,0:02:31.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,This place is dangerous ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.16,0:02:33.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's just a normal swamp.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.20,0:02:44.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this !?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.64,0:03:30.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Too weak...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.28,0:03:44.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is this where Teng One is hidden ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.96,0:03:47.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why is there no sect
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.68,0:03:49.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,guarding the first Spirit Vein ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.88,0:03:51.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow cultivator doesn't know,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.76,0:03:54.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,this vein is in a bottomless swamp.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.04,0:03:56.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Teng One cultivates there alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.48,0:04:00.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,For 400 years, the Core Family Members rotated a lot
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.76,0:04:01.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,but Teng One's name
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.92,0:04:03.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,has never changed owners.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.92,0:04:05.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,With his strength,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.40,0:04:08.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,there is no need to guard this vein.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.44,0:04:20.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Are you the person Teng Huayuan
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.40,0:04:21.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,spoke of ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.76,0:04:23.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't complicate things.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.84,0:04:32.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Come out !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.20,0:04:41.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Lord Immortal, calm your anger.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.84,0:04:43.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master is invincible !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.40,0:04:45.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Be it Teng One or Teng One-Hundred,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.12,0:04:46.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,they cannot match you !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.40,0:04:59.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,It failed ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.04,0:05:07.36,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1462,544)\fad(300,300)}Teng One\NTeng Family Core Member\NPeak Late stage Nascent Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.08,0:05:21.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,He...he...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.99,0:05:23.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,can resist Master !?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.36,0:05:27.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Teng Huayuan really raised 8 morrons.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.28,0:05:30.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,He really woke me up
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.28,0:05:35.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,to deal with a mere Early stage Nascent Soul brat ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.04,0:05:43.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,He's fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.32,0:06:02.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,His cultivation is deep...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.32,0:06:04.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,winning will be hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.88,0:06:19.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Dragon Restriction,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.20,0:06:19.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,activate !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.52,0:06:36.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,He is not afraid of the Ji Realm
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.16,0:06:37.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,and his body is strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.60,0:06:40.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,But he can be injured by the Restriction Flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.48,0:06:43.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,10 000 Swords Restriction,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.59,0:06:44.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,activate !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.16,0:06:53.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is this it ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.52,0:06:55.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're too weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.84,0:06:57.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,His body is on the verge of collapse
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.68,0:06:59.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,but he neither dodges nor retreats.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.60,0:07:00.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Something's wrong...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.40,0:07:04.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Slash !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.16,0:07:24.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,So you can destroy by body...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.80,0:07:28.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,you deserve praise.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.04,0:07:40.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Still alive ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.68,0:07:42.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.28,0:07:52.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ancestor,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.40,0:07:54.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,we should ask other clans
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.84,0:07:56.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,to assist Master Teng One
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.44,0:07:58.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,and ensure his victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.24,0:08:09.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Teng One is my disciple, the kind of genius
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.72,0:08:12.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,that is born only once per thousand years
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.44,0:08:14.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,He is only a step away from Soul Formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.08,0:08:17.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Because of his special Spirit Root,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.84,0:08:21.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,he was selected by the Envoy for a large scale experiment.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.84,0:08:23.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,The 9 Spirit Veins of Zhao
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.64,0:08:26.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,all feed the first Spirit Vein.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.92,0:08:29.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,In the Nascent Soul Realm,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.60,0:08:31.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Teng One is unmatched.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.56,0:08:34.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,As long as Wang Lin isn't Soul Formation,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.96,0:08:35.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,he will
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.28,0:08:37.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,die today.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.88,0:08:45.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,He died and already revived ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.76,0:08:47.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Ji Realm is useless against him ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.44,0:08:49.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.24,0:08:50.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,let's run away !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.64,0:08:52.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,No,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.20,0:08:54.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Teng One must have a weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.80,0:09:02.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Spirit Roots ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.64,0:09:06.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Not only did they take the spiritual energy from the mortal's Spirit Roots,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.20,0:09:09.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,but the Spirit Roots themselves are missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.00,0:09:11.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,The millions of Spirit Roots...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.64,0:09:13.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Where are they ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.24,0:09:25.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,The whole Black Swamp
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.12,0:09:27.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,is made of Spirit Roots !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.76,0:09:29.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Not just the swamp...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.52,0:09:31.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Teng One's body
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.32,0:09:32.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,is also made of Spirit Roots.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.80,0:09:35.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,He completely refined his body
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.92,0:09:37.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,to merge it with this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.40,0:09:41.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,He relies on the Spirit Roots in the swamp to revive.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.28,0:09:44.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,As long as there are Spirit Roots, he cannot die.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.24,0:09:47.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,My only shot is to sever his connection with this place,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.60,0:09:49.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,and kill him then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.84,0:09:56.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Little brat,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.28,0:10:00.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,you've been fooling around for a long time already,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.72,0:10:03.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,you can be proud of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.80,0:10:14.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is this...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.04,0:10:15.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,a restriction !?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.28,0:10:17.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,When did you make it ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.08,0:10:23.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,You are the one who is fooling around.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.00,0:10:25.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Underworld Sealing Restriction,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.68,0:10:26.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,activate !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.64,0:10:46.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Such a large restriction
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.68,0:10:50.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,to cut me off from all the Spirit Roots at once...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.08,0:10:53.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,I wanted to use the restriction to delay you
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.88,0:10:55.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,but freezing the Spirit Roots
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.04,0:10:57.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,is even better.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.64,0:11:51.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,What a domineering strength...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.72,0:12:01.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Good, good !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.84,0:12:05.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,I haven't enjoyed a good fight like this for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.52,0:12:06.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Little brat,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.92,0:12:08.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,this is the first time in 400 years
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.96,0:12:11.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,that I had to use this trick !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.72,0:12:29.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,This power...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.12,0:12:31.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,feels really familiar...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.76,0:12:55.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mere tricks !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.96,0:13:08.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is this...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.44,0:13:11.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ancient God Blood !?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.68,0:13:13.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Turns out such an artifact exists.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.28,0:13:21.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,It seems
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.72,0:13:23.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,he can only attack with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.72,0:13:25.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Futile !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.36,0:13:29.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,No matter how powerful your artifact is,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.32,0:13:32.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,it will only delay your death !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.48,0:13:34.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Not necessarily.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.48,0:13:36.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Explode !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.92,0:13:48.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Using a drop of Ancient God Blood
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.08,0:13:51.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,to imitate the original ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.64,0:13:53.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,You will never grasp its essence.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.00,0:13:55.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Little brat,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.48,0:13:56.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,let go !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.40,0:14:09.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Before you die,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.24,0:14:11.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will let you see
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.84,0:14:14.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,the power of a real Ancient God.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.08,0:14:25.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,One drop is enough
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.28,0:14:28.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,to summon the Ancient God's Demon Guardian.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.28,0:14:35.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Attack !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.32,0:14:49.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,To think that I
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.48,0:14:50.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,would actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.60,0:15:12.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Interesting...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.40,0:15:14.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Very interesting...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.40,0:15:27.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Reporting to Ancestor,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.88,0:15:30.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,the restriction around the city cannot be breached.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.40,0:15:33.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior requests Ancestors and the Nascent Soul Elders to act now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.92,0:15:36.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Forgive me Ancestor !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.92,0:15:37.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Forgive me !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.04,0:15:40.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,We Juniors are unable to handle this task.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.64,0:15:41.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,This will...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.80,0:15:46.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ancestor ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.60,0:15:58.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Teng One...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.76,0:15:59.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master Teng One, he...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.92,0:16:03.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,he...he...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.28,0:16:11.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Issue the order.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.96,0:16:13.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,All the disciples of the Teng Family
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.24,0:16:16.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,must immediately return to Teng Family City.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.80,0:16:18.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Summon the remaining Core Members
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.40,0:16:21.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,to follow me to activate the defense formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.60,0:16:24.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.60,0:16:43.48,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I've had my share of wounds,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.64,0:16:43.48,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}now I want to fight back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.56,0:16:47.04,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Is my destiny a wall of restrictions
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.12,0:16:52.96,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}that's blocking all my hopes
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.00,0:16:52.96,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}for life ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.76,0:16:58.72,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}My flesh and blood witnessed the past,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.48,0:16:58.72,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}my adversity pushed me to brave the waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.04,0:17:02.12,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}How do you navigate through the years passing by ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.48,0:17:08.12,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Nirvana and rebirth are no longer
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.20,0:17:08.12,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}out of reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.48,0:17:13.60,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Immortals
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.52,0:17:13.60,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}are obsessed with delusions of grandeur.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.88,0:17:17.64,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Renegades
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.64,0:17:17.64,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}seek to crush the impermanence of the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.64,0:17:21.48,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Don't tell me that I overestimate myself
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.59,0:17:21.48,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}and that the path to revenge leads to hell
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.72,0:17:25.60,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}because I don't see the harm in that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.60,0:17:33.40,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}My new body opens its eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.12,0:17:33.40,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}and awakens from its dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.52,0:17:40.96,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}I have overcome many trials
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.64,0:17:40.96,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}to get this body back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.16,0:17:48.60,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}No matter how many endless dark nights go by,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.20,0:17:48.60,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}I can still see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.00,0:17:57.96,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}By sticking to this thought, I will get it done
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.96,0:17:57.96,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}by my own hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.40,0:18:19.36,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}Returning to my body opened my eyes,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.12,0:18:19.36,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}I need to continue my Immortal journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.36,0:18:26.92,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}With a flick of a finger,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.80,0:18:26.92,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}only my indomitable heart remains.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.96,0:18:36.32,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}Life and death trials temper me, I am not afraid of losing my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.92,0:18:36.32,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}Even if there are countless tribulations and hardships.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.56,0:18:44.16,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}Overcome this fate, smash through the obstacles,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.08,0:18:44.16,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}like the descent of a god.
